{"id":"127af5e2492cd2af","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-halting-problem.md","title":"Halting Problem","display":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-halting-problem","aliases":["92-df-halting-problem"],"display":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-halting-set]]"],"source":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件","source_status":"外部递归论背景"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-halting-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-halting-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halting-problem — Halting Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论背景"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\)</span> (unary partial-recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (the fixed acceptable effective enumeration of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_1\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (diagonal halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HP}\\)</span> (definition-target binary halting set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\{\\varphi_e\\mid e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{HP}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\},\\qquad\nK=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\langle e,e\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HP}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\{\\varphi_e\\mid e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{HP}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\},\\qquad\nK=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\langle e,e\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HP}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>停机问题：判断程序是否终止</li>\n<li>Turing（1936）证明不可判定</li>\n<li>对角化论证：假设可判定则矛盾</li>\n<li>停机集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K = \\{e : f_e(e) \\downarrow\\}\">\\(K = \\{e : f_e(e) \\downarrow\\}\\)</span>不可判定</li>\n<li>停机问题与不完备性深度关联</li>\n<li>停机不可判定性可经有效算术化导出不完备性现象，但二者不是无条件的字面等价</li>\n<li>Turing跳跃基于停机问题的相对化</li>\n<li>Church-Turing论题下等价于不可解问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}_1$ (unary partial-recursive functions, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ (diagonal halting set, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\{\\varphi_e\\mid e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PartRec}_1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{HP}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\},\\qquad\nK=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\\langle e,e\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{HP}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"K = \\{e : f_e(e) \\downarrow\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"51f43fedeac3bf1d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\Phi_e^A)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed acceptable enumeration of the unary partial $A$-oracle-computable functions, relative version of [[92-df-halting-problem]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-problem]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","06a154edf19ea063"]}